            "subheading": "༶ Estimated Reading Time: 4-5 minutes ༶",
            "subheading_size": 1,
            "title": "Designing a Podcast Studio",
            "heading_size": 7,
            "text": "<p>We are thrilled to be designing a bespoke podcast room for Darbar Arts & Heritage Trust, the UK’s leading Indian Classical Music charity.</p><p>The challenge? Creating a multifunctional recording studio that delivers professional sound and video quality, reflects Darbar’s creative brand, and can adapt to future collaborators.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false,
            "show_social_links": false,
            "text_columns": 1,
            "align_text": "text-left",
            "bg_color": "#ab8c52",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_CzrqGD",
        "text_6EVrhk"
      ],
      "name": "Custom content",
      "settings": {
