    "section_rich_text_7XbMG6": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_iFjgpq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>3. Materials & Layout: Designed to Perform</h4><p></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TbRMpQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This wasn’t just an interiors job - it was about performance, efficiency, and long-term use. Every material was specified for function and durability:</p><p></p><p>༶ <strong>Milliken sound-absorbing carpet</strong> - reducing echo and adding warmth</p><p>༶ <strong>Allsfar acoustic wall panels & ceiling rafts</strong> - ideal for small space sound control</p><p>༶ <strong>Camera-ready lighting layout</strong> -  for sharp visual content</p><p>༶ <strong>Lockable storage</strong> for podcast gear and lighting equipment</p><p>༶ Smart <strong>plug + play electrical layout</strong> to suit any equipment setup</p><p>Working with <strong>Mount Lighting</strong> and <strong>Allsfar</strong>, we curated acoustic lighting and wall systems that look as good as they sound.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_iFjgpq",
        "text_TbRMpQ"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wrapper",
