    "section_columns_btTyJb": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "image_wVpjRj": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-07-31_at_17.24.37.png",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Design-Led Acoustics with Allsfar",
            "heading_size": 4,
            "text": "<p>We welcomed our Allsfar account manager to our Leicester studio to help specify the acoustics for the podcast room, offices, theatre and cafe in the new Darbar HQ. We selected the 'Ora V 'Geometric' design wall panels in 'Wheat Beige' to catch the coloured studio lights and change up the mood to suit each brand. Needless to say the panels were chosen for function as well as design, and will perform well in this space where sound is key. We also loved receiving the updated Allsfar Acoustic Sample Box with their huge range of colours - particularly loving the coloured neutrals for their versatility and timelessness. </p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        },
        "image_eHwAhh": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2e8acbcf-d5fc-42f1-abdd-dc934281fb27.jpg",
            "image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "mobile_image_aspect_ratio": 1,
            "image_shape": "normal",
            "title": "Carpet Tile Perfection with Milliken",
            "heading_size": 4,
            "text": "<p>Our lovely account manager visited our studio with sample folders at the ready to discuss both the bestselling collections, and the recently launched 'Pattern Play Collection'. We had first spotted this collection at Clerkenwell Design Week in May, and were keen to specify it from the outset. Linking with the yellow tones of the furniture in the renders, we selected a grey-yellow textural carpet tile from the range. We always love Miliken's design-forward approach and innovative printing methods - as someone form a textile print design background it's impossible not to nerd-out a little!</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": false
          }
        }
      },
