    "section_rich_text_mRwGbr": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_PFKR8W": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>4. Mood Lighting at its finest</h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_PCTRHg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We have visualised commercial-grade studio lighting positioned in the skirting and ceiling detailing for optimal video performance. The light fittings were mounted to work harmoniously with neutral-coloured walls - allowing future brands using the space to easily overlay their own colour palette in post-production or bring in soft props, branding, and background enhancements without clashing. The ambient lighting setup provides a professional-grade base for video content creators while still allowing flexibility.</p><p></p><p>Check out the different visuals we created by simply altering the lighting colour to switch-up the mood.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_wDzT4C": {
